From cf5215d157d38526f81ddcf546e3515f019e46d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craig Shaw <craig@craigshaw.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:50:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Allow continuation handoffs to known interpreted tails

Permit proven local saves at exact JML targets with no compiled variant. Reuse the existing owning-interpreter tail dispatch, while retaining balanced calls and returns and rejecting compiled or unresolved continuation tails. Validate stack restoration, cross-bank transfers and event recovery with synthetic programs.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
